  "description": "A professional fully configurable boxing round timer for iOS. Designed for training in any round sport such as boxing martial arts, wrestling, Mixed Martial Arts (MMA), Muay Thai, or for any other round timer needs.\n\nThe built-in Workout DJ can automatically play selected music every time you workout. External display support allows you to use from a large distance on your large screens.\n\nBASIC FEATURES:\nΓÇó Fully configurable sounds & times\nΓÇó Beautiful interface with large time display\nΓÇó Set times & sounds for preparation, round, warning, and rest\nΓÇó Color indication of phase\nΓÇó Blinking to alert warning\nΓÇó screen stays on automatically\nΓÇó Works with screen on, or off \nΓÇó Portrait & landscape support\nΓÇó Set sound volume and vibration (iPhone)\nΓÇó Pause and resume session\n\nADVANCED FEATURES:\nΓÇó Runs on iPhone + iPad\nΓÇó Airplay to external display for full-screen gym timer\nΓÇó Multitasking support\nΓÇó Start and change music automatically with Workout DJ\nΓÇó Programmable Presets\nΓÇó 9 Authentic sounds/bells\n\nUSES FOR THIS iOS iPhone & iPad APP:\nΓÇó Boxing Timer\nΓÇó Round Timer\nΓÇó Interval Timer\nΓÇó Countdown clock\nΓÇó Mixed Martial Arts (MMA)\nΓÇó Muay Thai\nΓÇó Kickboxing\nΓÇó Wrestling\nΓÇó Personal Boxing Training Timer\nΓÇó Gym Timer\n\nEnd user license agreement: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
